 rose in 7 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain and snow: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Denver's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (+0.03 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 14.2 inches a year. The wettest year was 1967 (23.31 in); the driest, 2002 (7.48 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 15 daily record highs, 1 daily record low"}}